{"2350790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moonlighter 2: The Endless Vault", "steam_appid": 2350790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/ef5ce19e010e30a62a1ab381bdacfefd.avif?t=1787644271\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras_big/ef5ce19e010e30a62a1ab381bdacfefd.avif?t=1787644271 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/2b0e8f1ceefe9ca5f0100d63077b7b5d.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=756 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/9842299602f3fad3e89865decf39f18a.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/9842299602f3fad3e89865decf39f18a.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/9842299602f3fad3e89865decf39f18a.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the double</strong> life of a resourceful merchant and fearless adventurer in this <strong>sequel to the hit rogue-lite Action-RPG!</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded without a coin in the village of Tresna, Will must <strong>open shop again as he dives into an interdimensional adventure</strong>. Explore dangerous dungeons, loot ancient relics, sell them, and reinvest in the town's prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magical, <strong>addictive loop returns</strong>—bigger, bolder, and packed with shiny loot.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0ab4f08c1a53fb7f0beded48158932bb.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0ab4f08c1a53fb7f0beded48158932bb.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0ab4f08c1a53fb7f0beded48158932bb.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profitable perils await as dimensional exploration evolves. Strap on your trusty <strong>backpack and master dynamic combat with various weapon classes, armor sets, and powerful perks</strong>.<br>  <br>Chart a path through unpredictable worlds, <strong>defeat relentless foes and formidable bosses</strong>, then carefully arrange your loot to unlock unique item synergies. Managing your backpack is key to financial success and maximizing profits.  <br> <br><strong>The deeper you go, the greater the rewards—and the risks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1ec3f467cadf83741c72ddcbc9191580.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1ec3f467cadf83741c72ddcbc9191580.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1ec3f467cadf83741c72ddcbc9191580.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every adventure, it's time to <strong>open for business</strong>. <strong>Customize your shop, set your prices, and read your customers to strike the perfect deal</strong>. <strong>Unlock sales perks</strong>, <strong>capitalize on special events</strong>, and <strong>optimize your displays</strong> to maximize profits.  <br> <br>From battered scrap to priceless relics, <strong>every item's value is yours to decide</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/41409c3d23944c85038ffb43f810af8c.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/41409c3d23944c85038ffb43f810af8c.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/41409c3d23944c85038ffb43f810af8c.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the <strong>Endless Vault,</strong> a mysterious ancient artifact that pushes your skills to the limit.  <br> <br>Overcome its ever-growing challenges to <strong>upgrade your town</strong> and earn increasingly valuable rewards. Will it be enough to <strong>reclaim your homeland</strong> from the evil <strong>Moloch</strong>, an interdimensional collector who has claimed your beloved village for himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5cf086dc7ee7bbc3980cf8ce36d610be.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5cf086dc7ee7bbc3980cf8ce36d610be.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5cf086dc7ee7bbc3980cf8ce36d610be.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Moonlighter’s stunning visual <strong>leap into 3D</strong>. Explore vibrant environments, enjoy smoother, more dynamic combat, and experience the iconic <strong>cycle of daytime shopkeeping and nighttime treasure hunting like never before.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/9842299602f3fad3e89865decf39f18a.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/9842299602f3fad3e89865decf39f18a.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/9842299602f3fad3e89865decf39f18a.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the double</strong> life of a resourceful merchant and fearless adventurer in this <strong>sequel to the hit rogue-lite Action-RPG!</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded without a coin in the village of Tresna, Will must <strong>open shop again as he dives into an interdimensional adventure</strong>. Explore dangerous dungeons, loot ancient relics, sell them, and reinvest in the town's prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magical, <strong>addictive loop returns</strong>—bigger, bolder, and packed with shiny loot.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0ab4f08c1a53fb7f0beded48158932bb.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0ab4f08c1a53fb7f0beded48158932bb.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0ab4f08c1a53fb7f0beded48158932bb.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profitable perils await as dimensional exploration evolves. Strap on your trusty <strong>backpack and master dynamic combat with various weapon classes, armor sets, and powerful perks</strong>.<br>  <br>Chart a path through unpredictable worlds, <strong>defeat relentless foes and formidable bosses</strong>, then carefully arrange your loot to unlock unique item synergies. Managing your backpack is key to financial success and maximizing profits.  <br> <br><strong>The deeper you go, the greater the rewards—and the risks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1ec3f467cadf83741c72ddcbc9191580.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1ec3f467cadf83741c72ddcbc9191580.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1ec3f467cadf83741c72ddcbc9191580.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every adventure, it's time to <strong>open for business</strong>. <strong>Customize your shop, set your prices, and read your customers to strike the perfect deal</strong>. <strong>Unlock sales perks</strong>, <strong>capitalize on special events</strong>, and <strong>optimize your displays</strong> to maximize profits.  <br> <br>From battered scrap to priceless relics, <strong>every item's value is yours to decide</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/41409c3d23944c85038ffb43f810af8c.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/41409c3d23944c85038ffb43f810af8c.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/41409c3d23944c85038ffb43f810af8c.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the <strong>Endless Vault,</strong> a mysterious ancient artifact that pushes your skills to the limit.  <br> <br>Overcome its ever-growing challenges to <strong>upgrade your town</strong> and earn increasingly valuable rewards. Will it be enough to <strong>reclaim your homeland</strong> from the evil <strong>Moloch</strong>, an interdimensional collector who has claimed your beloved village for himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5cf086dc7ee7bbc3980cf8ce36d610be.poster.avif?t=1787644271\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5cf086dc7ee7bbc3980cf8ce36d610be.webm?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5cf086dc7ee7bbc3980cf8ce36d610be.mp4?t=1787644271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Moonlighter’s stunning visual <strong>leap into 3D</strong>. Explore vibrant environments, enjoy smoother, more dynamic combat, and experience the iconic <strong>cycle of daytime shopkeeping and nighttime treasure hunting like never before.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Experience an action-RPG with roguelike elements where you live the double life of an adventurer and a merchant. Dive into vibrant dimensions to fight enemies, gather loot, and manage your backpack. Rebuild your shop and turn profits into gear for the next adventure!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Japanese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Fun, highly replayable, and even more intensive.”<br>Game Rant<br><br>“I didn’t anticipate just how much added depth there would be in the sequel.”<br>The Gamer<br><br>“A rare indie sequel that takes big swings rather than relying on the strength of the original to get by.”<br>DualShockers<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/c4fd5a1b23c369bf509d4792fae90df203bf11a3/header_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1787644271", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/cec652d6a85f26a1db23bd26c5f5e8b2c69c4f6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787644271", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/cec652d6a85f26a1db23bd26c5f5e8b2c69c4f6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787644271", "website": "https://digitalsungames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 2700 or Intel Core i5-10400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 5500 XT or NVidia GeForce GTX 1650 or Intel Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD (Recommended), HDD (Supported). Ultrawide screen supported. Please be aware that listed system requirements are for Early Access and may change before the full release of the game.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or Intel Core i5-12500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 5700 or NVidia GeForce RTX 3060 or Intel Arc A770<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD (Recommended). Ultrawide screen supported. Please be aware that listed system requirements are for Early Access and may change before the full release of the game.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "©11 BIT STUDIOS® is registered trademark of 11 BIT STUDIOS S.A. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nDigital Sun™, Moonlighter